      "value": "Could be useful, but I can also see why it wasn't added (if it was up for consideration at all). Physics, polygons, etc are not some of the more common 'toxic' elements in VRChat. That being said, it does improve performance, so having such an option would not be bad. But in most cases, even if not added, hiding the occasional avatars that abuse dynamic bones is always an option.",
